    "created_at": "2016-05-04T14:16:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-04T14:16:05Z",
    "body": "I agree with @domenic, you could say the same thing about all of them (dns-prefetch, preconnect, prefetch, prerender). \n\nThe thing I'm wondering about is whether the a/area authoring convenience is worth the overhead and burden. I'm guessing this would be really low priority feature for all the browser vendors, and to be honest, I'd rather focus their attention on getting other aspects of the hints implemented correctly.\n",
