    "body": "OK. So it sounds like the conclusion is just to bow to implemented reality and spec that prefetch works on a/area, but everything else only works on link?\n\nOr did I misunderstand implemented reality, and prefetch doesn't work on a/area either? I guess @igrigorik said \"maybe with exception of prefetch in some browsers (need to test)\". Leave it out for now?\n",
